IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sbia-boards`

-- School Boards (Incorporation) Act 1990, ss 2, 3(4)(h), (i), 4, 6, 8-11, 13, 14 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_school-boards-incorporation-act-1990.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

